   "text": "Back to: Nail POS Hub\nhttps://claude.ai/artifact/9HZ5deX1wVYaLzG895UciU\n\nRole: owner (admin). OPEN: V1 or V1.1? Proposal: V1 = points + gift cards (zero extra cost); packages, perks, referrals in V1.1. Decide with Elang.\nNo app or card: phone number = loyalty card. Rewards asked, perks shown + removable. Staff paid on full price; tips untouched.\nSample prices from a real salon menu (Cosmo Nails)."
